// Known issue (v4.129.0): this example does not currently compile.
// Cause: extern "Python" fn removed in v4.29.0 — use `mapanare bind --lang python`
// See docs/roadmap/v4/v4.129.0/EXAMPLES_REPORT.md for root cause and
// docket reference.
